{"id":"n29772-1-23","stage":0,"title":"참다 · 忍住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29772-1-23-1","ko":"감기가 심한가 보구나.","zh":"看来感冒很严重啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감기가","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기가","audio":"/audio/d900d01cd84038266b50.mp3"}},{"text":"심한가","meaning":"严重吗、看起来严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；-ㄴ가 与后面的 보다 合用，表示根据情况推测。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심한가","audio":"/audio/0a5768c1cedfeb985bc4.mp3"}},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来很严重啊","explanation":"-ㄴ가 보다：根据所见情况推测；-구나 表示感叹。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보구나","audio":"/audio/63677854531485540e78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3","entryId":"28635","definition":"一般伴有咳嗽、流鼻涕、头痛、发冷等症状的传染病。","pronunciation":["감ː기"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cfea50c27f47584aa017.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29772-1-23-2","ko":"응, 도저히 기침을 참기 힘드네.","zh":"嗯，实在忍不住咳嗽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"응：非敬语肯定回应，意为“嗯”。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"도저히","meaning":"实在、怎么也","explanation":"도저히：怎么也、实在；与后面的 힘들다 合用，表示难以忍住。","readings":[{"term":"도저히","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14397","senseId":"1","lemma":"도저히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도저히","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3"}},{"text":"기침을","meaning":"咳嗽","explanation":"기침：咳嗽；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기침","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38465","senseId":"1","lemma":"기침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기침을","audio":"/audio/4c0b047c8a4a74735a27.mp3"}},{"text":"참기","meaning":"忍住","explanation":"참다：忍住生理反应；-기 将动作名词化，与 힘들다 合用表示“难以忍住”。","readings":[{"term":"참다","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29772","senseId":"1","lemma":"참다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참기","audio":"/audio/7f37913c6dfe4b820af6.mp3"}},{"text":"힘드네.","meaning":"很难","explanation":"힘들다：困难；-네 表示发现后感叹，这里说咳嗽难以忍住。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘드네","audio":"/audio/7bd0e0e3eecd7eec6d3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"嗯","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"对前面关于感冒的推测作肯定回应。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"f875011623286e4a","term":"도저히","zh":"实在、怎么也","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3","entryId":"14397","definition":"表示无论怎样都难以做到；这里指难以忍住咳嗽。","pronunciation":["도ː저히"]},{"id":"aa2351b107c95734","term":"기침","zh":"咳嗽","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3","entryId":"38465","definition":"空气从肺部通过喉咙突然喷出来，同时发出粗声。","pronunciation":["기침"]},{"id":"1cfaf7914b38f877","term":"참다","zh":"忍住","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3","entryId":"29772","definition":"抑制咳嗽等生理反应。","pronunciation":["참ː따"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f5e66aaf55da9c4b2504.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.792,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29772","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2164,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，实在忍不住咳嗽。","看来感冒很严重啊。","我得回家了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来感冒很严重啊。","我得回家了。","嗯，实在忍不住咳嗽。"],"answer":2}]}
